/* ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
   MAP POP-UPS (v3.21.0)
   Tapping a station, marker, county or outlook area on a map opens a pop-up at that
   spot with the same report that appears under the map. Works on the regional map
   and the SPC / WPC / CPC outlook maps. Tap elsewhere on the map, or the X, to close.
   ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ */
